Z||000004||ChadMan||01-20-2000||08:42 AM||||You guys are dead-nuts accurate!  I saw a near-mint 88 GT (medium red metallic, black wheels, gray interior, 5-sp, 65K) at a local Pontiac dealer for $7995 in the summer of 97.  They only wanted to give me $1500 for my 88 Coupe, which looked as good as the GT.||||reg||1
